                                                            <a href="#0"
                                data-a11y-dialog-show="a11y-dialog"
                                data-dialog-title='Charlotte Vickers'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Charlotte is a director who uses theatre to explore the worlds that we live in and the worlds we might create. Previous work at Shakespeare’s Globe includes <em>Cymbeline</em> (Assistant Director).</p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/charlotte-vickers/">View full biography</a>
