                                            src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2025/12/Sami-Fendall.jpg?resize=320%2C320&gravity"
                                            alt="Sami Fendall looking directly at the camera. They have long dark hair and are wearing a black top."
                                            title="Sami-Fendall">
