                                                                    </a>
                                                    </div>
                    				                                            <div class="o-layout__item c-col-bio-single">
                            <h3 class="c-col-bio__role u-h3">Director</h3>
                                                            <a href="#0"
                                data-a11y-dialog-show="a11y-dialog"
                                data-dialog-title='Chelsea Walker'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Chelsea Walker is an award-winning theatre director. Her recent work includes a UK premiere of <em>R.O.I (Return on Investment)</em> by Aaron Loeb for Hampstead Theatre Downstairs and a new production of <em>All’s Well That Ends Well </em>for<em> </em>Shakespeare’s Globe.</p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/chelsea-walker/">View full biography</a>
                                '

                                                                    data-dialog-img='<figure class="c-col-bio__mugshot">
                                        <img
                                            src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2024/07/Chelsea-Walker.jpg?resize=320%2C320&gravity"
                                            alt="This is a headshot of Chelsea Walker looking direct to camera."
                                            title="Chelsea-Walker">
                                    </figure>'
                                                                class="c-dialog--open c-link">
                                                                            <h4 class="c-col-bio__name u-h5">Chelsea Walker</h4>
                                                                    </a>
                                                    </div>
                    				                                            <div class="o-layout__item c-col-bio-single">
                            <h3 class="c-col-bio__role u-h3">Fight Director</h3>
                                                            <a href="#0"
                                data-a11y-dialog-show="a11y-dialog"
                                data-dialog-title='Kevin McCurdy'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Kev is an Equity Registered Fight Director of 25 years, Stage Combat Tutor of 35 years &amp; Co-Founder of The Academy of Performance Combat. Previous work for Shakespeare’s Globe includes: <em>The Lightning Child, Eyam, The Duchess of Malfi, Othello, Edward II, All’s Well That Ends Well, Romeo and Juliet, The Crucible.</em></p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/kevin-mccurdy/">View full biography</a>
                                '

                                                                    data-dialog-img='<figure class="c-col-bio__mugshot">
                                        <img
                                            src="https://images.shakespearesglobe.com/uploads/2019/03/0002_Kevin-McCurdy.jpg?resize=320%2C320&gravity"
                                            alt="This is a headshot of Kevin McCurdy looking directly into camera."
                                            title="_0002_Kevin McCurdy">
                                    </figure>'
                                                                class="c-dialog--open c-link">
                                                                            <h4 class="c-col-bio__name u-h5">Kevin McCurdy</h4>
                                                                    </a>
