                                                            <a href="#0"
                                data-a11y-dialog-show="a11y-dialog"
                                data-dialog-title='Lucy Fennell'
                                data-dialog-content='<p>Lucy Fennell is an intimacy director for live performance and an intimacy coordinator for TV and film. Previous work at Shakespeare’s Globe includes <em>All&#8217;s Well That Ends Well.</em></p>
<br>
                                                                    <a href="https://www.shakespearesglobe.com/bio/lucy-fennell/">View full biography</a>
                                '

                                                                    data-dialog-img='<figure class="c-col-bio__mugshot">
